  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_Act3_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ada709a341202e547bbe6949723084f1, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 2857957019607042
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2857957023801344
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2857957002829824
    m_Localized: "The stove has gone out completely. There is still some firewood
      \u2014 I need to light it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2857957019607040
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2857957019607041
    m_Localized: Light the stove
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2857957023801345
    m_Localized: The stove has gone out... I can't see a thing. I need to light the
      fire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2857957023801346
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2857957023801347
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707478993362944
    m_Localized: Notice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723072
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723073
    m_Localized: Read
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723074
    m_Localized: He's gone!...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723075
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723076
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723077
    m_Localized: A log?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723078
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723079
    m_Localized: I don't know...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723080
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723081
    m_Localized: No, it can't be the same one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723082
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723083
    m_Localized: How did it get here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723084
    m_Localized: Is it the same one?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723085
    m_Localized: Maybe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723086
    m_Localized: '"The fire has grown even dimmer."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723087
    m_Localized: Stove
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723088
    m_Localized: '"The fire has grown a little brighter."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723089
    m_Localized: Stove
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723090
    m_Localized: I need to find more firewood before it gets dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723091
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723092
    m_Localized: They should still be handing out firewood at the hospital, if I
      can get there in time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723093
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723094
    m_Localized: I don't want to tear apart the house again. There's almost nothing
      left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723095
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723096
    m_Localized: Add firewood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723097
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723098
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723099
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723100
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723101
    m_Localized: I need to get back before the fire goes out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723102
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723103
    m_Localized: Leave the house
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723104
    m_Localized: Our son... Is he with you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723105
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723106
    m_Localized: Who else would he be with? How did it go with the document?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723107
    m_Localized: Wife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723108
    m_Localized: So they won't move anyone in with us?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723109
    m_Localized: Wife
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723110
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723111
    m_Localized: I got it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723112
    m_Localized: No, now...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723113
    m_Localized: My son!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723114
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723115
    m_Localized: Step away from the cot!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723116
    m_Localized: A photographer came to Yelanka back then. We had a family photograph
      taken.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723117
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723118
    m_Localized: We were all still together then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723119
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723120
    m_Localized: Now this is the only place we're all together. On the wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723121
    m_Localized: Protagonist
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723122
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723123
    m_Localized: Continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4707479022723124
    m_Localized: Leave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4711410436136960
    m_Localized: 'TOMSK PROVINCIAL

      EXTRAORDINARY COMMISSION

      FOR COMBATING
      TYPHUS

      NOTICE

      8 January 1920

      No. 47

'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4711410436136961
    m_Localized: 'Authorized Representative of Chekatif

      A. P. Vedeneyev

      Signature

      Seal'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4711410436136962
    m_Localized: 'To the owner of this house

      An inspection has established
      that these premises are occupied by one person and contain vacant living space.

      Pursuant
      to a resolution of the Extraordinary Commission for Combating Typhus, you are
      hereby ordered to make the vacant space available to accommodate persons referred
      by the Commission.

      The premises must be ready for occupancy no later
      than 10 January of this year.

      The date and time of occupancy will be
      communicated separately.

      Failure to comply with this notice shall be
      referred to the Extraordinary Commission for review.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
